<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said analyst Peter Treadway raised his end-1998 target price on Brazilian telecommunications firm Telebras to $180 from $165.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Treadway said the Latin telecommunications rally has further to go, the stock is very cheap in terms of its expected growth rate, and the Brazilian government is still dedicated to privatizing Telebras at the highest possible price.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 161-7/8 Monday.</p>
</text>
